{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MassTheory.BindingSaturationCapA4","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MassTheory.BindingSaturationCapA4","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.exchangeDet_pow_two_le_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.exchangeDet_pow_two_le_three","kind":"theorem","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/BindingSaturationCapA4.lean#L92-L111","doc":"**The A=3 pairwise saturation cap (determinant form).** On `[0,1]`,\n`det_2(m)^3 ≤ det_3(m)`, i.e. `(1−m²)^3 ≤ (1+2m)(1−m)^2`.\n\nVia `exp`-monotonicity this is exactly `b_3(m) ≤ 3·b_2(m)`, i.e.\n`ρ_3(m) ≤ C(3,2) = 3`.\n\nCompanion to `exchangeDet_pow_two_le_four`, and strictly easier: the\ndifference factors exactly,\n\n  `det_3 − det_2^3 = m^3 (1−m)^2 (m+2)`,\n\nso no Bernstein certificate is needed — the sign is read off the\nfactorisation.  Cancelling `(1−m)^2` leaves the bare identity\n`(1−m)(1+m)^3 − (1+2m) = −m^3(2+m)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.exchangeDet_pow_two_le_four","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.exchangeDet_pow_two_le_four","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/BindingSaturationCapA4.lean#L68-L90","doc":"**The A=4 pairwise saturation cap (determinant form).** On `[0,1]`,\n`det_2(m)^6 ≤ det_4(m)`, i.e. `(1−m²)^6 ≤ (1+3m)(1−m)^3`.\n\nVia `exp`-monotonicity this is exactly `b_4(m) ≤ 6·b_2(m)`, i.e.\n`ρ_4(m) ≤ C(4,2) = 6`: the isospin-even log-det cumulant's magnitude ratio\nis capped at the pairwise edge count `C(4,2)`.\n\nProof: `det_4 − det_2^6 = m^3(1−m)^3·S(m)` with `S ≥ 0` on `[0,1]` by a\nnonnegative Bernstein expansion (all coeffs `≥ 0`). ","signatureChunk":0}]}